---
// Static inline SVG, site tokens only, no ids/markers. All values come from the code shown next to the figure in the post.
---
<figure class="gp7b">
  <div class="gp7b-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 200" role="img" aria-label="Five steps of a buffered channel with capacity 2: empty, two values fit, both received, two more fit, and a fifth send blocks because the buffer is full.">
<text x="20" y="24" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>The buffer of make(chan int, 2) after each step</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Buffer của make(chan int, 2) sau mỗi bước</tspan></text>
<text x="95" y="64" class="strong" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>make(chan int, 2)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>make(chan int, 2)</tspan></text>
<rect class="bar" x="30" y="82" width="60" height="44" rx="3"/>
<rect class="bar" x="100" y="82" width="60" height="44" rx="3"/>
<text x="95" y="152" class="mute num" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>len 0, cap 2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>len 0, cap 2</tspan></text>
<text x="95" y="176" class="mute" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>room for two</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>còn chỗ cho hai</tspan></text>
<polygon class="gparrow" points="192,104 184,99.5 184,108.5"/>
<line class="vline" x1="178" y1="104" x2="186" y2="104"/>
<text x="271" y="64" class="strong" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>ch &lt;- 1, ch &lt;- 2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ch &lt;- 1, ch &lt;- 2</tspan></text>
<rect class="bar" x="206" y="82" width="60" height="44" rx="3"/>
<text x="236" y="110" text-anchor="middle" class="strong">1</text>
<rect class="bar" x="276" y="82" width="60" height="44" rx="3"/>
<text x="306" y="110" text-anchor="middle" class="strong">2</text>
<text x="271" y="152" class="mute num" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>len 2, cap 2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>len 2, cap 2</tspan></text>
<text x="271" y="176" class="mute" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>both fit</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>vừa cả hai</tspan></text>
<polygon class="gparrow" points="368,104 360,99.5 360,108.5"/>
<line class="vline" x1="354" y1="104" x2="362" y2="104"/>
<text x="447" y="64" class="strong" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>&lt;-ch, &lt;-ch</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>&lt;-ch, &lt;-ch</tspan></text>
<rect class="bar" x="382" y="82" width="60" height="44" rx="3"/>
<rect class="bar" x="452" y="82" width="60" height="44" rx="3"/>
<text x="447" y="152" class="mute num" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>len 0, cap 2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>len 0, cap 2</tspan></text>
<text x="447" y="176" class="mute" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>1 and 2 came out, in order</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1 và 2 ra theo thứ tự</tspan></text>
<polygon class="gparrow" points="544,104 536,99.5 536,108.5"/>
<line class="vline" x1="530" y1="104" x2="538" y2="104"/>
<text x="623" y="64" class="strong" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>ch &lt;- 3, ch &lt;- 4</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ch &lt;- 3, ch &lt;- 4</tspan></text>
<rect class="bar" x="558" y="82" width="60" height="44" rx="3"/>
<text x="588" y="110" text-anchor="middle" class="strong">3</text>
<rect class="bar" x="628" y="82" width="60" height="44" rx="3"/>
<text x="658" y="110" text-anchor="middle" class="strong">4</text>
<text x="623" y="152" class="mute num" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>len 2, cap 2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>len 2, cap 2</tspan></text>
<text x="623" y="176" class="mute" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>full again</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lại đầy</tspan></text>
<polygon class="gparrow" points="720,104 712,99.5 712,108.5"/>
<line class="vline" x1="706" y1="104" x2="714" y2="104"/>
<text x="799" y="64" class="strong" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>ch &lt;- 5</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ch &lt;- 5</tspan></text>
<rect class="bad" x="734" y="82" width="60" height="44" rx="3"/>
<text x="764" y="110" text-anchor="middle" class="strong">3</text>
<rect class="bad" x="804" y="82" width="60" height="44" rx="3"/>
<text x="834" y="110" text-anchor="middle" class="strong">4</text>
<text x="799" y="152" class="mute num" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>len 2, cap 2</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>len 2, cap 2</tspan></text>
<text x="799" y="176" class="badtx" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>send blocks, buffer is full</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>gửi bị chặn, buffer đầy</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption><span data-lang-en>The same steps as the program above, left to right. A send waits only when the buffer is full, and a receive waits only when it is empty.</span><span data-lang-vi>Các bước giống chương trình ở trên, từ trái sang phải. Lệnh gửi chỉ phải chờ khi buffer đầy, lệnh nhận chỉ phải chờ khi buffer rỗng.</span></figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp7b { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp7b-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp7b svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gp7b text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp7b .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp7b .lane { fill: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 600; }
  .gp7b .bar { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp7b .wait { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .gp7b .bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .gp7b .badtx { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .gp7b .mute { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp7b .strong { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }
  .gp7b .vline { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp7b .vline.red { stroke: var(--red); }
  .gp7b .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp7b .arrow { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp7b .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gp7b figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
